# PsyConnect Platform - Development Rules & Standards

## 🎯 Project Overview

**PsyConnect** is a comprehensive mental health platform connecting users with therapists through consultations, chat, and community features.

### Tech Stack
- **Backend**: Java Spring Boot (microservices), Go (logging, notification)
- **Frontend**: Angular (webapp), Flutter (mobile)
- **Infrastructure**: Kafka, MySQL, Redis, Docker
- **Monitoring**: Grafana, Prometheus, Loki, Tempo

### AI Assistant Rules
- **DO NOT** create documentation files (`.md`, `rules.md`, etc.) unless explicitly requested
- **DO NOT** create summary files automatically
- **ONLY** create files when user specifically asks for them
- Focus on code implementation, not documentation generation

---

## 🏗️ Architecture

### Microservices Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    API Gateway (8888)                    │
│              Spring Cloud Gateway + JWT                  │
└───────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────┘
                │
    ┌───────────┴───────────┬──────────────┬──────────────┐
    │                       │              │              │
┌───▼────┐  ┌──────▼──────┐ ┌─────▼─────┐ ┌────▼────────┐
│Identity│  │   Profile   │ │Consultation│ │    Chat     │
│ (8080) │  │   (8081)    │ │   (8083)   │ │   (8084)    │
└────────┘  └─────────────┘ └────────────┘ └─────────────┘
     │             │              │              │
     └─────────────┴──────────────┴──────────────┘
                   │
            ┌──────▼──────┐
            │    Kafka    │
            │   (19092)   │
            └──────┬──────┘
                   │
     ┌─────────────┴──────────────┐
     │                            │
┌────▼────────┐         ┌────────▼─────┐
│  Logging    │         │ Notification │
│   (Go)      │         │    (Go)      │
│  (8085)     │         │   (8082)     │
└─────────────┘         └──────────────┘
```

---

## 🔌 Port Allocation

### Services
| Service | Port | Protocol | Description |
|---------|------|----------|-------------|
| **API Gateway** | 8888 | HTTP | Main entry point |
| **Identity Service** | 8080 | HTTP | Authentication & Authorization |
| **Profile Service** | 8081 | HTTP | User profiles & social |
| **Notification Service** | 8082 | HTTP | Email & push notifications |
| **Consultation Service** | 8083 | HTTP | Therapist consultations |
| **Chat Service** | 8084 | HTTP/WS | Real-time messaging |
| **Logging Service** | 8085 | HTTP | Centralized logging |
| **Recommendation Service** | 8086 | HTTP | Content recommendations |

### Infrastructure
| Service | Port | Description |
|---------|------|-------------|
| **MySQL** | 3306 | Database |
| **Redis** | 6379 | Caching |
| **Kafka** | 19092 | Message broker (host) |
| **Kafka** | 9094 | Message broker (Docker) |
| **Zookeeper** | 2181 | Kafka coordination |
| **Grafana** | 3000 | Monitoring dashboard |
| **Prometheus** | 9090 | Metrics collection |
| **Loki** | 3100 | Log aggregation |
| **Tempo** | 3200 | Distributed tracing |
| **Kafka UI** | 8090 | Kafka management |
| **Dozzle** | 9999 | Docker logs viewer |

### Frontend
| Service | Port | Description |
|---------|------|-------------|
| **Angular Webapp** | 4200 | Web application |
| **Flutter Mobile** | 8100 | Mobile app (dev) |

