```

#### Naming Conventions
- **Components**: `feature-name.component.ts` (kebab-case)
- **Services**: `feature-name.service.ts`
- **Models**: `feature-name.model.ts`
- **CSS Classes**: BEM methodology (`block__element--modifier`)

#### State Management
- Use **RxJS** for reactive state
- Use **Signals** for local component state
- Avoid global state unless necessary

#### Icons & Graphics - CRITICAL RULES ⚠️

**NEVER use icon libraries (Font Awesome, Material Icons, etc.)**

**ALWAYS use inline SVG instead**

##### ❌ WRONG - Never do this:
```html
<!-- DON'T use icon libraries -->
<i class="fa fa-user"></i>
<mat-icon>home</mat-icon>
<ion-icon name="heart"></ion-icon>
```

```typescript
// DON'T import icon libraries
import { FontAwesomeModule } from '@fortawesome/angular-fontawesome';
import { MatIconModule } from '@angular/material/icon';
```

##### ✅ CORRECT - Always do this:
```html
<!-- Use inline SVG -->
<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm0 3c1.66 0 3 1.34 3 3s-1.34 3-3 3-3-1.34-3-3 1.34-3 3-3zm0 14.2c-2.5 0-4.71-1.28-6-3.22.03-1.99 4-3.08 6-3.08 1.99 0 5.97 1.09 6 3.08-1.29 1.94-3.5 3.22-6 3.22z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg>

<!-- Or create reusable SVG components -->
<app-icon-user></app-icon-user>
<app-icon-heart></app-icon-heart>
```

```typescript
// Create SVG icon components
@Component({
  selector: 'app-icon-user',
  standalone: true,
  template: `
    <svg [attr.width]="size" [attr.height]="size" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
      <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10..." [attr.fill]="color"/>
    </svg>
  `
})
export class IconUserComponent {
  @Input() size = 24;
  @Input() color = 'currentColor';
}
```

##### Why inline SVG?
1. **No external dependencies** - Reduces bundle size
2. **Full control** - Customize colors, sizes, animations
3. **Performance** - No font loading, instant rendering
4. **Accessibility** - Better screen reader support
5. **Reliability** - No CDN failures or network issues

##### SVG Best Practices:
```scss
// Make SVG responsive
svg {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  display: block;
}

// Use currentColor for theme support
.icon {
  svg path {
    fill: currentColor;
  }
}

// Size variants
.icon--sm svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; }
.icon--md svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; }
.icon--lg svg { width: 32px; height: 32px; }
```

##### API Responses - No Icon References:
```json
// ❌ WRONG - Don't send icon names
{
  "status": "success",
  "icon": "fa-check-circle"  // DON'T DO THIS
}

// ✅ CORRECT - Send semantic data only
{
  "status": "success",
  "type": "success"  // Frontend decides which SVG to show
}
```

