## 🔐 Security Standards

### Authentication & Authorization

#### JWT Token Structure
```json
{
  "sub": "user-id",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "role": "USER|THERAPIST|ADMIN",
  "iat": 1234567890,
  "exp": 1234567890
}
```

#### API Security
- **All endpoints** require JWT except `/v1/identity/register`, `/v1/identity/login`
- **Role-based access**: `@PreAuthorize("hasRole('ADMIN')")`
- **CORS**: Allow `localhost:4200`, `localhost:8100`, production domains
- **Rate limiting**: 100 requests/minute per IP

### Password Requirements
- Minimum 8 characters
- At least 1 uppercase letter
- At least 1 lowercase letter
- At least 1 number
- BCrypt hashing with strength 12

---

## 📡 Kafka Topics

### Naming Convention
`service-name.event-type`

### Topics List
```yaml
# Logging
- logging-service              # All service logs

# Notifications
- notification.user-create     # User registration
- notification.user-activate   # Account activation
- notification.user-reset      # Password reset
- notification.account-change  # Account updates
- notification.therapist-approve
- notification.therapist-reject
- notification.push.new-message
- notification.push.consultation-created
- notification.push.consultation-updated
- notification.push.consultation-reminder
- notification.push.consultation-completed
- notification.push.profile-update
- notification.push.profile-approved
- notification.push.profile-rejected
- notification.push.new-review
- notification.push.new-client
- notification.push.system
- notification.social.post-upvote
- notification.social.post-bookmark
- notification.social.post-share
- notification.social.post-comment
- notification.social.user-follow

# Events
- user.created
- user.updated
- consultation.created
- consultation.updated
- message.sent
```

### Message Format
```json
{
  "eventId": "uuid",
  "timestamp": "2025-12-23T10:00:00Z",
  "service": "identity-service",
  "eventType": "user.created",
  "data": {
    "userId": "123",
    "email": "user@example.com",
    "username": "johndoe"
  }
}
```

