## 🐳 Docker & Deployment

### Environment Variables

#### Development (.env)
```bash
# Database
DB_HOST=localhost
DB_PORT=3306
DB_NAME=psyconnect_dev
DB_USER=root
DB_PASSWORD=password

# Kafka
KAFKA_BROKERS=127.0.0.1:19092  # Local
# KAFKA_BROKERS=kafka:9094      # Docker

# Redis
REDIS_HOST=localhost
REDIS_PORT=6379

# JWT
JWT_SECRET=your-secret-key
JWT_EXPIRATION=86400000

# SMTP
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=your-email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=your-app-password
```

#### Docker Compose
```yaml
services:
  service-name:
    build:
      context: ../services/servicename
    container_name: psyconnect-servicename-dev
    ports:
      - "8080:8080"
    environment:
      - KAFKA_BROKERS=kafka:9094
      - DB_HOST=mysql
    depends_on:
      kafka:
        condition: service_healthy
      mysql:
        condition: service_healthy
    restart: unless-stopped
```

